fysetc-5inch-dsi-touch (0.2.0) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Backlight driver fysetc_sleep: the screen wakes up after sleep.
    Brightness is on/off (below 30% off), and replaces
    rpi_panel_attiny_regulator, also in the initramfs.
  * The package is arm64.
  * The kernel modules are licensed GPL-2.0.

